        <descript>
            <abstract>The New Hampshire Senate District Boundaries, 2022, contains the district boundaries drawn by the New Hampshire Legislature based on the 2020 US Census population count. Boundaries were derived by applying district codes retrieved from the NH Secretary of State web site to the geometry provided by the GRANIT town boundary layer (PBNH).</abstract>
            <purpose>These data may be used to represent New Hampshire's Senate Districts.</purpose>
            <supplinf>Data distribution tile: statewide</supplinf>
        </descript>
